/* MILESTONE 1.4 CONTRACTS — exact names and signatures. [track] = owner/implementer; others import, never edit.
   1.3, used as is (follow the landed code if it differs; report it):
   - sessionGeneration.ts: getSessionGeneration, bumpSessionGeneration, onSessionGeneration
   - projectDocument/initialState.ts: initialProjectState, resetProjectState
   - persistence/saveStatusStore.ts: useSaveStatusStore {documentVersion, baselineVersion, baselineFingerprint, savedComplete}, attachDocumentObserver, noteSynthPatchChange, documentFingerprint(state?, synthPatches?), markDocumentBaseline({savedComplete?}), isDocumentDirty
   - SessionSerializer.ts: serializeSession, deserializeSession, isLoadableSession, serializeSessionForCloud, deserializeCloudProject
   - projectDocument/{codec,quarantine}.ts: SESSION_SCHEMA_VERSION, the unreadable prefix, the pre-v3 backup key
   - fields.ts: registry lists, fieldDefault
   - 1.3's registry trigger subscription (in useAutosave.ts) and its save serialization (in api.ts) */

